  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675902",
      "title": "Adding Server-side Validation",
      "lectureOrder": 65,
      "videoOrder": 59,
      "sourceHash": "ba9197ddac112fcb02f9a31b4a15ff0539100e646e319f454cbf70472e4f7ddc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 2.933,
          "en": "So now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.933,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "we're adding expenses with that action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 8.1,
          "en": "Before we now continue with loading data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 11.04,
          "en": "and updating, or deleting expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.04,
          "end": 12.57,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we also add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 15.36,
          "en": "server-side validation logic here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.36,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "Now, we already do validate user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 20.61,
          "en": "with help of client-side validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "because in this ExpenseForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "I do have these extra validation attributes on my inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "like required or max length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 31.26,
          "en": "And these are standard attributes you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 34.11,
          "en": "to these input elements to get some default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.11,
          "end": 37.143,
          "en": "client-side validation performed by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "You can see this in action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 41.61,
          "en": "if you go back to this Add Expense page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 44.79,
          "en": "And if you try to submit this without entering anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.79,
          "end": 48.66,
          "en": "I for example get this error message shown by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.66,
          "end": 51.27,
          "en": "If I enter something here, I get it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.27,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "So I do get some validation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 56.91,
          "en": "I for example also can't enter a negative amount here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.91,
          "end": 59.25,
          "en": "at least not with these errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.25,
          "end": 60.21,
          "en": "If I do enter one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.21,
          "end": 62.34,
          "en": "I get an error that it must be positive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.34,
          "end": 64.23,
          "en": "because I also added this check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "that the minimum value for the amount is zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 70.92,
          "en": "So I got extra validation like this built in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "thanks to the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 74.763,
          "en": "But of course, this is just client-side validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.6,
          "end": 77.58,
          "en": "It could be disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.58,
          "end": 79.92,
          "en": "by for example using the developer tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.92,
          "end": 83.52,
          "en": "And then I could simply remove these fields here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 86.55,
          "en": "I could set this to minus 10 as a minimum value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.55,
          "end": 89.373,
          "en": "And all of a sudden minus five is allowed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 91.86,
          "en": "So this can be circumvented.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.86,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "Most users of course don't do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 96.42,
          "en": "And therefore, it's a great feature nonetheless",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 97.8,
          "en": "because it makes it very easy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 100.17,
          "en": "for you to provide a better user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 100.17,
          "end": 103.68,
          "en": "by telling users right away if something is wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 106.65,
          "en": "But if some malicious user wants to sneak",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.65,
          "end": 109.14,
          "en": "some broken data into your database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.14,
          "end": 112.53,
          "en": "they could do it by disabling this validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 112.53,
          "end": 115.53,
          "en": "with the dev tools as I just showed it to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 116.94,
          "en": "And for those reasons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 121.35,
          "en": "you also always wanna add server-side validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.35,
          "end": 124.62,
          "en": "Now, this can be done by going to this action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 124.62,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "And there before we actually store data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 130.65,
          "en": "in the database with help of this AddExpense function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.65,
          "end": 134.133,
          "en": "we wanna validate the data submitted by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.12,
          "end": 140.1,
          "en": "And to validate that data, you find another file attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.1,
          "end": 142.82999999999998,
          "en": "the validation.server.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.82999999999998,
          "end": 145.44,
          "en": "which you should paste into your data folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 148.833,
          "en": "next to database.server and expenses.server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 152.88,
          "en": "In this validation.server.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.88,
          "end": 155.91,
          "en": "you find a bunch of validation functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.91,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "which I predefined with some standard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 159.9,
          "en": "JavaScript code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.9,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "Nothing Remix-specific where I essentially repeat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.95,
          "end": 166.44,
          "en": "the validation performed by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.44,
          "end": 171.03,
          "en": "Just this time on the server where users can't circumvent it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 173.973,
          "en": "because they don't have access to the server-side code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 177.6,
          "en": "So here I'm also checking if a title for example exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 177.6,
          "end": 179.94,
          "en": "And if it's not long,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 179.94,
          "end": 184.94,
          "en": "if the amount entered is positive, and things like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "And then I got to this function, validate expense input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "which simply calls all these other functions step-by-step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 193.2,
          "en": "and creates an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.2,
          "end": 196.86,
          "en": "that contains all the errors that I might find.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.86,
          "end": 199.11,
          "en": "So for every validation that fails,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 199.11,
          "end": 202.35,
          "en": "a new key is added to this object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 202.35,
          "end": 205.56,
          "en": "And this key then stores some error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.56,
          "end": 208.68,
          "en": "And ultimately, if I do have at least one error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.68,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "I then throw this error object as part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 214.38,
          "en": "of this function so that if I have no errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.38,
          "end": 216.12,
          "en": "this function does nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.12,
          "end": 219.18,
          "en": "it doesn't return anything, and it froze nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.18,
          "end": 221.7,
          "en": "But if I have at least one validation error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.7,
          "end": 223.14,
          "en": "this function will throw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.14,
          "end": 226.113,
          "en": "and it will throw that validation error data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.37,
          "end": 229.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, that means that this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 229.07999999999998,
          "end": 232.26,
          "en": "can now be called in this action here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 232.26,
          "end": 235.56,
          "en": "So here I can call validateExpenseInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.56,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "this function which I just showed you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 241.08,
          "en": "And for that it of course must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.08,
          "end": 242.52,
          "en": "from that data folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 242.52,
          "end": 246.27,
          "en": "and there from the validation.server file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 246.27,
          "end": 251.07,
          "en": "And then to validate ExpenseInput, I pass my expense data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 255.03,
          "en": "So this object here I get from my user input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 255.03,
          "end": 256.98,
          "en": "I get from the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.98,
          "end": 258.42,
          "en": "And then as I just explained,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 258.42,
          "end": 262.47,
          "en": "this function will throw an error if something goes wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 262.47,
          "end": 266.58,
          "en": "So I will simply try executing this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 266.58,
          "end": 270.33,
          "en": "And if I catch an error, I know that validation failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.33,
          "end": 271.47,
          "en": "And therefore here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.47,
          "end": 275.52,
          "en": "I then wanna make sure that I show the user this feedback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 275.52,
          "end": 278.403,
          "en": "I tell the user about the failed validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.27,
          "end": 280.103,
          "en": "Now for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 280.103,
          "end": 281.88,
          "en": "I could throw another error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 281.88,
          "end": 285.69,
          "en": "so that Remix error-handling capabilities",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 285.69,
          "end": 287.52,
          "en": "are being used for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 287.52,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "for example showing a default error page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 291.12,
          "en": "I could do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.12,
          "end": 294.48,
          "en": "and I'll get back to error handling later again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 294.48,
          "end": 297.09000000000003,
          "en": "But here I don't wanna show some error page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 297.09000000000003,
          "end": 298.77,
          "en": "if something goes wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 298.77,
          "end": 302.25,
          "en": "Instead I wanna show this form here again, this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 302.25,
          "end": 303.12,
          "en": "But in that form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 303.12,
          "end": 305.55,
          "en": "I wanna show that error message to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 305.55,
          "end": 309,
          "en": "so that it's quite easy for the user to fix their error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309,
          "end": 310.353,
          "en": "and resubmit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 312.03,
          "end": 315.93,
          "en": "Therefore, I don't wanna throw the error here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 315.93,
          "end": 319.29,
          "en": "but instead I'll return this error object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 319.29,
          "end": 322.14,
          "en": "Because this error object here which I caught",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 322.14,
          "end": 325.35,
          "en": "is simply this validation error's object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 325.35,
          "end": 328.29,
          "en": "which has these key value pairs of the key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 328.29,
          "end": 330.93,
          "en": "describing the input for which the error occurred",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 330.93,
          "end": 335.22,
          "en": "and then the value describing what went wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 335.22,
          "end": 338.79,
          "en": "So I'm returning this object with error information here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 338.79,
          "end": 342.54,
          "en": "And if you return some raw data in an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 342.54,
          "end": 344.61,
          "en": "instead of returning a redirect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 344.61,
          "end": 345.84000000000003,
          "en": "then of course the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 345.84000000000003,
          "end": 348.24,
          "en": "will not be redirected to another page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 348.24,
          "end": 350.15999999999997,
          "en": "This should make sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 350.15999999999997,
          "end": 351.96,
          "en": "And instead you can access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 351.96,
          "end": 355.5,
          "en": "this returned data in your components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 355.5,
          "end": 358.59000000000003,
          "en": "And for that, we can go to the ExpenseForm again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 358.59000000000003,
          "end": 361.11,
          "en": "which is being displayed at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.11,
          "end": 364.62,
          "en": "this form is submitted and this error is caught.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 364.62,
          "end": 369.42,
          "en": "And in there we can call useActionData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 369.42,
          "end": 373.98,
          "en": "which is imported from remix-run at React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 373.98,
          "end": 377.52,
          "en": "to get hold of that data returned by the action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 377.52,
          "end": 378.71,
          "en": "And I did already mention this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 378.71,
          "end": 380.43,
          "en": "in the Remix Essentials section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 380.43,
          "end": 381.9,
          "en": "but I am repeating it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 381.9,
          "end": 384.63,
          "en": "because it is an important concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 384.63,
          "end": 386.82,
          "en": "It's also important to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 386.82,
          "end": 388.98,
          "en": "that you can call useActionData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 388.98,
          "end": 392.4,
          "en": "just like useLoaderData in any component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 392.4,
          "end": 394.98,
          "en": "not just in the route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 394.98,
          "end": 397.8,
          "en": "We could call it here in add.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 397.8,
          "end": 399.18,
          "en": "which is the route component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 399.18,
          "end": 401.73,
          "en": "being loaded related to this action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 401.73,
          "end": 404.76,
          "en": "But we can also call it in any other component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 404.76,
          "end": 408.12,
          "en": "that's the end rendered by this route component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 408.12,
          "end": 411.3,
          "en": "And since ExpenseForm is rendered by this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 411.3,
          "end": 413.90999999999997,
          "en": "we can also call useActionData here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 413.90999999999997,
          "end": 415.05,
          "en": "In general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 415.05,
          "end": 418.14,
          "en": "useActionData and useLoaderData will give you access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 418.14,
          "end": 419.67,
          "en": "to the closest action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 419.67,
          "end": 422.673,
          "en": "or loader that was called for this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 423.84,
          "end": 426.72,
          "en": "So here I then get my validation errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 426.72,
          "end": 428.52,
