        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 468.63,
          "end": 471.63,
          "en": "hence I'm checking for it to be set first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 471.63,
          "end": 473.88,
          "en": "And if it's set, if it's truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 473.88,
          "end": 476.64,
          "en": "that means I do have some validation errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 476.64,
          "end": 479.64,
          "en": "And then I wanna display an unordered list",
